!!<*yamlover: $defs: board>
workflow: *:: yamlover: ontos: workflow: dev
buy-groceries.yo: !!<*yamlover: $defs: task> Buy groceries
  description: The weekly shopping run — Saturday morning, before the market gets crowded.
  priority: normal
  - !!<*yamlover: $defs: bullets>
    - milk
    - eggs
    - rye bread
    - coffee beans
    - dish soap
    - matches
  - The greengrocer takes cash only.
clean-the-oven.yo: !!<*yamlover: $defs: task> Clean the oven
  &:: yamlover: ontos: workflow: dev: done: -
  &:: yamlover: ontos: colors: yellow: -
  description: The full works — racks out, soda paste overnight, wipe down.
  priority: normal
  assignee: dims
  - Done last weekend; the racks soaked in the bathtub with a dryer sheet.
descale-the-kettle.yo: !!<*yamlover: $defs: task> Descale the kettle
  &:: yamlover: ontos: workflow: dev: ready: -
  description: The kettle takes twice as long to boil — limescale again.
  priority: low
  - Citric acid works better than vinegar and leaves no smell; one tablespoon per litre.
  - Boil, let it sit for half an hour, rinse twice.
fix-the-leaky-tap.yo: !!<*yamlover: $defs: task> Fix the leaky tap
  &:: yamlover: ontos: colors: yellow: -
  &:: yamlover: ontos: workflow: dev: ready: -
  description: The bathroom tap drips overnight — replace the washer, or the whole cartridge.
  priority: high
  assignee: dims
  estimate: 2h
  - Turn the water off at the small valve under the sink FIRST.
  - A half-inch washer kit is in the garage toolbox, middle drawer.
repaint-the-fence.yo: !!<*yamlover: $defs: task> Repaint the garden fence
  &:: yamlover: ontos: workflow: dev: in-progress: -
  description: The south side peeled over the winter — strip and repaint before the rains.
  priority: normal
  assignee: dims
  due: "2026-08-30"
  estimate: 2d
  - Check the forecast first — the paint needs two dry days.
  - Scrape and sand the peeled boards
    - The heat gun is faster on the thick patches.
  - Prime the bare wood
  - Two coats of the green from the shed
    - About half a can is left; buy one more.
